{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/learn/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/learn/[slug]/page,_N_T_/learn/how-to-enable-notify"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--2DJ2zhzL_dHSrK5QsdDKA--><html lang=\"zh-TW\" data-density=\"comfortable\" data-font-size=\"standard\" class=\"__variable_07e1b6 __variable_cc7473 h-full antialiased\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/3d26d2f3aa81a833-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/604a121a6fa1a135-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/6e1768769e6f59a2-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ab2e3a11646b0499-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/75c047ba52e43fcc.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/aa90c9a426448e43.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/e55779c04dd245e2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/8c57d5c3b938342e.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/3eaf36e367672966.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-100b9d70ed4e49c1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1255-ab54a41c275880be.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-acf4587a940f1946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/learn/%5Bslug%5D/page-f7b99344f7e2ee16.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>股市大佬通知怎麼設定？App權限、主題與成交量條件｜股市大佬 TradeBoss</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"手機允許通知，不等於每一種市場事件都會推播。你還需要在App選擇主題，並確認事件是否符合設定的條件。請把手機權限、站內設定與實際事件分開檢查。\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-theme');if(t!=='light'&&t!=='dark')t='dark';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);document.documentElement.style.colorScheme=(t==='light'?'light':'dark');}catch(e){document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme','dark');}})();(function(){try{if(localStorage.getItem('obsidian-comfort-read')==='1')document.documentElement.classList.add('comfort-read');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var s=localStorage.getItem('obsidian-updown');if(s==='us')document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-updown','us');}catch(e){}})();(function(){try{var prefs=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('bs-preferences-v1')||'{}');var root=document.documentElement;prefs=prefs&&typeof prefs==='object'?prefs:{};root.setAttribute('data-font-size',['standard','large','xlarge','huge'].indexOf(prefs.fontSize)>=0?prefs.fontSize:'standard');root.setAttribute('data-density',prefs.density==='compact'?'compact':'comfortable');}catch(e){}})();</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground selection:bg-cyan/30 review-mode pb-40 lg:pb-16\" data-review-theme=\"dark\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-link fixed left-3 top-3 z-[80] -translate-y-24 rounded-xl bg-accent px-4 py-2 font-black text-bg shadow-lg transition focus:translate-y-0\">跳到主要內容</a><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"LearnArticle_wrap__LIQ8G\"><article class=\"LearnArticle_article__2nBbk\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_meta__etj_G\"><a class=\"LearnArticle_cat__GQMlg\" href=\"/learn?c=platform\">平台教學</a><span class=\"LearnArticle_read__QEj6a\">閱讀約 2 分鐘</span></p><h1 class=\"LearnArticle_title__0_la8\">股市大佬通知怎麼設定？App權限、主題與成交量條件</h1><details class=\"LearnArticle_toc__LcSAa\"><summary class=\"LearnArticle_tocSummary__YBddG\">本文目錄</summary><ol class=\"LearnArticle_tocList__Rq_Lz\"><li><a href=\"#sec-1\">三個地方要分開看</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-2\">從哪裡設定？</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-3\">漲幅達8%，不是預告即將鎖漲停</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-4\">成交量要看累計，還是單筆？</a></li><li><a href=\"#sec-5\">站內有記錄，但手機沒有跳出？</a></li></ol></details><div class=\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\"><p class=\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\">手機允許通知，不等於每一種市場事件都會推播。你還需要在App選擇主題，並確認事件是否符合設定的條件。請把手機權限、站內設定與實際事件分開檢查。</p><section id=\"sec-1\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">三個地方要分開看</h2><div class=\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\"><table class=\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\"><thead><tr><th>檢查項目</th><th>你要確認什麼</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>手機系統</td><td>允許App通知，並檢查專注模式及通知摘要設定</td></tr><tr><td>App通知設定</td><td>登入正確帳號，開啟想收到的主題；確認個人的彙整或節流設定</td></tr><tr><td>事件條件</td><td>漲幅、成交量等條件是否都符合；未達條件不會因開啟主題就一定通知</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"sec-2\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">從哪裡設定？</h2><ol class=\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\"><li>開啟<a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/review\">通知中心</a>查看主題與個人設定。</li><li>盤中也可以在<a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/diary\">盤中工作區</a>切到「通知設定」，不必離開工作區。</li><li>收到訊息後先看日期、時間、價格與成交量，確認不是舊通知。</li></ol></section><section id=\"sec-3\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">漲幅達8%，不是預告即將鎖漲停</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">漲幅通知描述系統資料在觸發時已達到的條件，不是預測之後會發生什麼。例如通知顯示漲幅達8%，不能解讀為之後一定會漲停，更不代表買賣建議。除權息等情況也要使用當日適用的參考價，不能一律拿昨收自行比較。</p></section><section id=\"sec-4\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">成交量要看累計，還是單筆？</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">請依欄位標示判讀。當日累計成交量是截至資料時間的累計，不是剛剛一筆的量；張數與股數也不能混用。不同通知主題的條件可能不同，以當頁說明與自己的設定為準。</p></section><section id=\"sec-5\" class=\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\"><h2 class=\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\">站內有記錄，但手機沒有跳出？</h2><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">站內通知與裝置推播是不同階段。即使站內已產生記錄，網路、系統權限、專注模式或推播服務仍可能影響手機呈現。不要反覆註冊帳號；請透過App回饋提供發生時間、股票代號與裝置版本，勿提供密碼或驗證碼。</p><p class=\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\">接著閱讀<a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/learn/how-to-read-order-book-five-levels\">五檔與實際成交的差別</a>，或到<a class=\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\" href=\"/diary\">正式App安裝頁</a>確認安裝入口。</p></section></div></article></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1cf2182201f6bdb6.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[81259,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[89379,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[98924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[10021,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[10528,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n8:I[50861,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-4382c12d510386d3.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\nc:I[57150,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/3d26d2f3aa81a833-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/604a121a6fa1a135-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"cros